# Per-repo SCOPED credentials. Copy to .env (gitignored, chmod 600); NEVER commit real values.
# Activate per-repo loading: `direnv allow` (or `source .envrc`).
# GH_TOKEN: a GitHub fine-grained PAT scoped to THIS repo (Contents RW, Pull requests RW, Metadata R).
GH_TOKEN=github_pat_scoped_to_THIS_repo
